  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Brand introduction</strong>: Underdog Press is an indie publisher that publishes \"Stories Beyond Basic.\" We don't want to put out the same cookie cutter stories but are seeking unique science fiction and fantasy that blurrs genre lines.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Product description</strong>: We sell books and gear specific to our books.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong>:&nbsp; Our books focus on blurring genre lines. We're also working to be a space where writers of color can find an outlet for their work.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Payment terms</strong>: We're just starting out and will begin with 15% commission on all sales. Once we see how things go we will setup a tiered model.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Other information</strong>: Our goal is to partner with you on an on going basis. I understand starting a business like this comes down to hard work and a little bit of luck. I also realize that no one does it alone and we at Underdog Press appreciate your help in showcasing new indie authors.</p>\r\n</div>",
